What Vehicles May Qualify?

California Lemon Law applies to many types of consumer vehicles covered by qualifying warranties, including:

- Pickup trucks

- Certain recreational vehicles

- Some motor homes

Eligibility depends on the warranty, repair history, and the nature of the defect rather than the vehicle category alone.

